  "faq": {
    "q1": "How do I publish a listing?",
    "a1": "Sign up, fill in your listing through a short wizard, and choose a package. Once an admin approves it, your listing becomes visible to guests.",
    "q2": "Does Rentaj charge a commission?",
    "a2": "No. Rentaj never takes a cut of your bookings — we only earn from the owner's monthly or yearly subscription. All booking money goes straight to you.",
    "q3": "Can I connect my existing calendar?",
    "a3": "Yes, iCal sync (import and export) is available, so you avoid double bookings if you already list elsewhere.",
    "q4": "Who can use Rentaj?",
    "a4": "Anyone renting out real estate, event spaces, playrooms, vehicles, machinery, or equipment.",
    "q5": "What kinds of bookings can I use?",
    "a5": "Direct bookings, per-stay or per-slot bookings, with or without a built-in booking system — whatever fits your needs.",
    "q6": "Can guests message me before booking?",
    "a6": "Yes, the built-in messaging system lets guests reach you directly on the platform, before and after booking."
  },
